类型=枚举
说明=枚举译码：是否用于成品 0否  1是
列=CASE WHEN (UPPER(RTRIM(CAST(tdef.ifProduct AS NVARCHAR(20)))) IN (N'0', N'FALSE', N'N', N'NO') OR UPPER(RTRIM(CAST(tdef.ifProduct AS NVARCHAR(20)))) = N'否') THEN N'否' WHEN (UPPER(RTRIM(CAST(tdef.ifProduct AS NVARCHAR(20)))) IN (N'1', N'TRUE', N'Y', N'YES') OR UPPER(RTRIM(CAST(tdef.ifProduct AS NVARCHAR(20)))) = N'是') THEN N'是' ELSE CAST(tdef.ifProduct AS NVARCHAR(20)) END | 是否用于成品
禁止=tdef.ifProduct AS [是否用于成品]

[映射 ifwip]
